<title>LEBANON: SOCCER-LEBANON AND CZECH REPUBLIC DRAW 3-3 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEBANON AND CZECH REPUBLIC DRAW 3-3 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon and the Olympic team of</p>
<p>the Czech Republic drew 3-3 (halftime 1-1) in a soccer friendly</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Lebanon - Terro Kehyaian 32, Wartan Ghazarian 85,  Zaher</p>
<p>al-Indari 88</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Mehoda Michal 10, Siegel Patrik 56, 80</p>
</text>
